      "The comments come as competition intensifies among Amazon, Microsoft (NASDAQ:MSFT), Google (NASDAQ:GOOG) and IBM (NYSE:IBM) to commercialize quantum computing. Microsoft has previously said it expects a commercially viable quantum machine by 2029."
